like to leave behind in 2020.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.160
I agree, I mean, it has been a rough year.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.750
If only we could just flush it all away.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:14.980
Ah, interesting brand
conscious word choice, Andy.

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:15.830
'Cause lucky for us

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.430
Cottonelle is giving
people the opportunity

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:22.140
