00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.430
the Refreshingly Clean Slate.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:30.090
What a great way to start 2021 fresh.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.650
Right again, Andy.

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:34.450
Everyone who participates
will have a chance to win

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:39.450
