00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:55.150
We should enter.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.020
Good idea, Andy.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.680
All contestants have to do
is write one thing from 2020

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.870
